+3. **M5–M7** — research/script quality, footage licensing manifest, AI visuals.
+4. **M8–M10** — presenter/voice, English subtitle sync, render quality gates.
+5. **M11–M12** — browser-visible dashboard/approval and private/unlisted upload
+   with the review package attached.
+6. **M13–M14** — end-to-end production acceptance test and final audit.
+
+Each milestone ships as its own branch and pull request with CI evidence; no
+milestone is marked complete without a run that produced a real artifact.
